  "README.md": {
    "body": {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "html": "<h1 data-b=\"6e8c49c6ca01f758\" id=\"reading-showcase\">Reading showcase</h1>",
          "id": "6e8c49c6ca01f758",
          "kind": "h1",
          "lineEnd": 9,
          "lineStart": 9
        },
        {
          "html": "<p data-b=\"5321c4139258cb20\">A page of everything the reading view draws. It links to the <a href=\"docs/guide.md\">guide</a>, to a <a href=\"docs/nope.md\">missing page</a> and to <a href=\"#diagrams\">a section</a>. Code references open in your editor: <code>src/main.rs:12</code>, and plain text like src/main.rs:3 works too.</p>",
          "id": "5321c4139258cb20",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineEnd": 11,
          "lineStart": 11
        },
        {
          "html": "<h2 data-b=\"873c5f87daea9d00\" id=\"text-and-lists\">Text and lists</h2>",
          "id": "873c5f87daea9d00",
          "kind": "h2",
          "lineEnd": 13,
          "lineStart": 13
        },
        {
          "html": "<p data-b=\"a5341c8c93a6c5b5\">Paragraphs keep a comfortable measure at <strong>any</strong> zoom: <em>emphasis</em>, <code>inline code</code>, <del>strike</del>, a footnote<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn-1\" id=\"fnref-1\" data-footnote-ref=\"\">1</a></sup> and an autolink <a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>. Press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>F</kbd> to find in page.</p>",
          "id": "a5341c8c93a6c5b5",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineEnd": 15,
          "lineStart": 15
        },
        {
          "html": "<ul data-b=\"e5c2585e73eec433\" class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\"> Render Markdown</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\"> Keep my place when the file changes</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" disabled=\"\"> Review the changes</li>\n</ul>",
          "id": "e5c2585e73eec433",
          "kind": "ul",
          "lineEnd": 19,
          "lineStart": 17
        },
        {
          "html": "<ol data-b=\"15fd71eacccb3241\">\n<li>First</li>\n<li>Second\n<ul>\n<li>nested item</li>\n<li>another one</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>",
          "id": "15fd71eacccb3241",
          "kind": "ol",
          "lineEnd": 24,
          "lineStart": 21
        },
        {
          "html": "<div data-b=\"4039196382a45f77\" class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\">\n<p class=\"markdown-alert-title\">Note</p>\n<p>Alerts come with a title and an icon.</p>\n</div>",
          "id": "4039196382a45f77",
          "kind": "div",
          "lineEnd": 27,
          "lineStart": 26
        },
        {
          "html": "<div data-b=\"473128ef3bce20dd\" class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-warning\">\n<p class=\"markdown-alert-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>Reading is the main mode. Beautiful, clear reading is a requirement.</p>\n</div>",
          "id": "473128ef3bce20dd",
          "kind": "div",
          "lineEnd": 30,
          "lineStart": 29
        },
        {
          "html": "<h2 data-b=\"3c47fb4f8c38266d\" id=\"code\">Code</h2>",
          "id": "3c47fb4f8c38266d",
          "kind": "h2",
          "lineEnd": 32,
          "lineStart": 32
        },
        {
          "html": "<pre data-b=\"b04254981a03178d\"><code class=\"language-rust\">fn main() {\n    let name = \"PerMark\";\n    println!(\"Hello, {name}!\");\n}\n</code></pre>",
          "id": "b04254981a03178d",
          "kind": "pre",
          "lineEnd": 39,
          "lineStart": 34
        },
        {
          "html": "<pre data-b=\"48208e466c8d0b0e\"><code class=\"language-json\">{ \"name\": \"permark\", \"private\": true, \"version\": \"0.6.0\" }\n</code></pre>",
          "id": "48208e466c8d0b0e",
          "kind": "pre",
          "lineEnd": 43,
          "lineStart": 41
        },
        {
          "html": "<h2 data-b=\"f086e37712246e23\" id=\"tables\">Tables</h2>",
          "id": "f086e37712246e23",
          "kind": "h2",
          "lineEnd": 45,
          "lineStart": 45
        },
        {
          "html": "<table data-b=\"1bef1313d773460b\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Feature</th>\n<th>Status</th>\n<th>Notes</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Tables</td>\n<td>done</td>\n<td>Zebra rows, sticky header</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Math</td>\n<td>done</td>\n<td>KaTeX, loaded when needed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Diagrams</td>\n<td>done</td>\n<td>Mermaid and PlantUML in page</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
          "id": "1bef1313d773460b",
          "kind": "table",
          "lineEnd": 51,
          "lineStart": 47
        },
        {
          "html": "<h2 data-b=\"9d35b0bf7336ecf1\" id=\"math\">Math</h2>",
          "id": "9d35b0bf7336ecf1",
          "kind": "h2",
          "lineEnd": 53,
          "lineStart": 53
        },
        {
          "html": "<p data-b=\"8a4f9da86326315a\">Inline math <span data-math-style=\"inline\">E = mc^2</span> sits in the text. A display formula:</p>",
          "id": "8a4f9da86326315a",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineEnd": 55,
          "lineStart": 55
        },
        {
          "html": "<p data-b=\"90bb95a3830c8bd8\"><span data-math-style=\"display\">\n\\int_0^\\infty e^{-x^2}\\,dx = \\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{2}\n</span></p>",
          "id": "90bb95a3830c8bd8",
          "kind": "p",
          "lineEnd": 59,
          "lineStart": 57
        },
        {
          "html": "<h2 data-b=\"c88ae3e0aaae1228\" id=\"diagrams\">Diagrams</h2>",
          "id": "c88ae3e0aaae1228",
          "kind": "h2",
          "lineEnd": 61,
          "lineStart": 61
        },
        {
          "html": "<pre data-b=\"ae4de58cc43ef70f\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">graph LR\n  A[Markdown] --&gt; B(Render)\n  B --&gt; C{Sanitize}\n  C --&gt;|safe| D[Page]\n  C --&gt;|unsafe| E[Dropped]\n</code></pre>",
          "id": "ae4de58cc43ef70f",
          "kind": "pre",
          "lineEnd": 69,
          "lineStart": 63
        },
        {
          "html": "<h2 data-b=\"810676eb3ab98479\" id=\"prompt-blocks\">Prompt blocks</h2>",
          "id": "810676eb3ab98479",
          "kind": "h2",
          "lineEnd": 71,
          "lineStart": 71
        },
        {
          "html": "<details data-b=\"03f8544ce18765a3\" class=\"prompt-block\" data-tag=\"context\" open=\"\"><summary>context</summary>\n<p>You are reading a prompt file. The tags below fold, and <strong>Markdown inside them</strong> still renders.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Variables look like <span class=\"tvar\">{{customer_name}}</span> and are marked.</li>\n<li>Files are linked: see <a class=\"at-ref\" href=\"/docs/guide.md\">@docs/guide.md</a> for the guide.</li>\n</ul>\n</details>",
          "id": "03f8544ce18765a3",
          "kind": "details",
          "lineEnd": 77,
          "lineStart": 74
        },
        {
          "html": "<details data-b=\"2e3e3c7fb133d8c8\" class=\"prompt-block\" data-tag=\"instructions\" open=\"\"><summary>instructions</summary>\n<ol>\n<li>Be brief.</li>\n<li>Quote the source.</li>\n</ol>\n</details>",
          "id": "2e3e3c7fb133d8c8",
          "kind": "details",
          "lineEnd": 82,
          "lineStart": 81
        },
        {
          "html": "<section data-b=\"72d9896ee9d78f62\" class=\"footnotes\" data-footnotes=\"\">\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn-1\">\n<p>Footnotes list at the end of the page, with a way back. <a href=\"#fnref-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" data-footnote-backref-idx=\"1\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1\">↩</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>",
          "id": "72d9896ee9d78f62",
          "kind": "section",
          "lineEnd": 85,
          "lineStart": 85
        }
      ],
